    "title": "Duke vs TCU schedule, TV channel, how to watch March Madness game",
    "text": "March 19, 2026Updated March 20, 2026, 9:54 a.m. MTNo. 9 seed TCU and No. 1 seed Duke play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Saturday, March 21.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the East Region March Madness second-round game.TCU defeated No. 8 seed Ohio State in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 66-64.Duke beat No. 16 seed Siena in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 71-65.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game schedule, TV channelsWatch Duke vs TCU on FUBO (free trial)What time is the TCU vs Duke March Madness game?The Duke vs TCU NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 2:15 p.m. MST on Saturday, March 21.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Duke vs TCU March Madness game on?The TCU vs Duke Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on CBS.March Madness picks: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the TCU vs Duke March Madness game?Duke vs TCU can be streamed on FUBO and other streaming services that carry CBS. FUBO offers a free trial.Who are the announcers for the Duke vs TCU March Madness game?Ian Eagle will have the play-by-play call of the TCU Horned Frogs vs Duke Blue Devils NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Bill Raftery and Grant Hill as the analysts and Tracy Wolfson as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
